1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,500
Yasuo killed his brother with his own hands.

2
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:06,360
But for Yone, death was not the end.

3
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:14,841
Yone lived by honor and duty.

4
00:00:15,101 --> 00:00:20,781
He was still a child when they lost their father,
but he chose to become his family's protector.

5
00:00:21,531 --> 00:00:25,044
Once, honor was above everything.

6
00:00:25,894 --> 00:00:28,674
His brother Yasuo was his opposite:

7
00:00:28,734 --> 00:00:30,614
brash and reckless.

8
00:00:30,834 --> 00:00:33,594
Still, the two were inseparable.

9
00:00:33,894 --> 00:00:38,235
When Yone began studying at the
village sword school, Yasuo followed.

10
00:00:38,935 --> 00:00:43,915
When Elder Souma wanted Yasuo
as his student, Yasuo refused.

11
00:00:44,235 --> 00:00:48,955
Yone gave him a maple seed, the
school's symbol of humility.

12
00:00:49,655 --> 00:00:51,955
A seed is only a seed.

13
00:00:52,195 --> 00:00:56,176
But given time, the beauty it
carries within can be seen.

14
00:00:57,276 --> 00:00:59,556
But Yone had his doubts.

15
00:00:59,716 --> 00:01:03,996
He feared his brother's impulsiveness
would make him a poor student.

16
00:01:04,236 --> 00:01:09,276
Still, Elder Souma was a respected master
who did not make careless decisions.

17
00:01:09,976 --> 00:01:15,897
Yone kept training with dual blades and
soon earned the respect of every disciple.

18
00:01:16,097 --> 00:01:20,117
The brothers' sparring duels
were a joy to them both.

19
00:01:20,317 --> 00:01:22,297
But that joy did not last.

20
00:01:22,997 --> 00:01:24,777
War came to Ionia.

21
00:01:25,037 --> 00:01:29,318
Yone left with the other
disciples to fight against Noxus.

22
00:01:29,518 --> 00:01:33,798
Yasuo reluctantly stayed
behind to protect his master.

23
00:01:34,498 --> 00:01:37,118
One night, Elder Souma was found dead.

24
00:01:37,358 --> 00:01:40,058
He had been killed by the
very wind technique he taught.

25
00:01:40,338 --> 00:01:43,478
When Yone returned, Yasuo had already fled.

26
00:01:44,178 --> 00:01:46,299
This shook Yone to his core.

27
00:01:46,359 --> 00:01:48,059
And he blamed himself.

28
00:01:48,299 --> 00:01:52,459
If Yasuo had killed his master, Yone had
failed to teach him the righteous path.

29
00:01:52,619 --> 00:01:56,239
If he had abandoned his post, Yone
had failed to give him discipline.

30
00:01:56,939 --> 00:02:00,409
Yasuo had already killed several
of those who pursued him.

31
00:02:00,439 --> 00:02:05,500
And to Yone, that blood stained his
own hands as much as his brother's.

32
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:08,380
Tomorrow at first light, I will set out.

33
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:10,740
To catch a sword without a sheath:

34
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,220
my brother, Yasuo.

35
00:02:13,420 --> 00:02:17,980
He found him. When their swords
crossed, Yone's steel was unmatched.

36
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:21,380
But Yasuo's wind cut his brother down.

37
00:02:22,130 --> 00:02:24,661
We killed each other
while we were still alive.

38
00:02:25,511 --> 00:02:27,431
But death was not the end.

39
00:02:27,651 --> 00:02:32,771
When Yone awoke in the spirit realm,
the weight of his failure crushed him.

40
00:02:32,971 --> 00:02:35,151
In rage, he pounded his fists on the ground.

41
00:02:35,901 --> 00:02:38,367
I thought death would bring peace.

42
00:02:40,113 --> 00:02:41,716
How naive.

43
00:02:42,566 --> 00:02:44,786
Then he heard a rumbling laugh.

44
00:02:44,966 --> 00:02:50,907
He turned and saw a monstrous,
humanlike spirit with a blood-red blade.

45
00:02:51,067 --> 00:02:57,227
It was an azakana: a predatory being that
had long stalked Yone from beyond the veil.

46
00:02:57,927 --> 00:03:00,707
Before Yone could say a
word, the creature struck.

47
00:03:00,807 --> 00:03:05,427
Yone summoned the spiritual echoes of his
blades and blocked the blow just in time.

48
00:03:05,507 --> 00:03:09,028
His swordsmanship was still unmatched,
but he was overwhelmed by magic.

49
00:03:09,728 --> 00:03:14,288
Anger took him. A lifetime of honor
and duty snapped in an instant.

50
00:03:14,368 --> 00:03:18,208
Yone wrested the creature's blade
from its hand and ran it through.

51
00:03:18,908 --> 00:03:23,548
The last thing he heard before a new
darkness took him was that same laughter.

52
00:03:27,448 --> 00:03:30,369
When Yone came to, he was
in the material realm.

53
00:03:30,469 --> 00:03:33,479
But it was a grim shadow of what it had been.

54
00:03:33,509 --> 00:03:36,089
In his hand was a blood-red sword.

55
00:03:36,839 --> 00:03:38,732
Death turned me away.

56
00:03:39,582 --> 00:03:43,282
On his face, a mask had formed in
the shape of the azakana's face.

57
00:03:43,382 --> 00:03:48,523
He could not remove it. But now, through
its eyes, he could see other azakana.

58
00:03:49,273 --> 00:03:54,869
When it met me in the spirit realm,
the azakana on my face knew me.

59
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:58,359
These creatures were not yet true demons.

60
00:03:58,539 --> 00:04:03,819
They fed on people's pain and grew until
one day they could devour their hosts.

61
00:04:04,059 --> 00:04:05,919
But Yone discovered something:

62
00:04:06,139 --> 00:04:10,779
whoever learns an azakana's name
can turn it into a lifeless mask.

63
00:04:11,529 --> 00:04:14,574
Every trait of an azakana is a line.

64
00:04:15,016 --> 00:04:19,645
Together, the lines reveal its true name.

65
00:04:20,495 --> 00:04:25,795
One night, a thirteen-year-old boy was
running for his life through a dark forest.

66
00:04:26,035 --> 00:04:28,315
What frightened him was not the darkness.

67
00:04:28,455 --> 00:04:33,175
It was the thing in the darkness. And
that thing had whispered the boy's name.

68
00:04:33,875 --> 00:04:35,895
As he ran, the boy crashed into someone.

69
00:04:35,955 --> 00:04:39,516
A tall man with strange
masks hanging from his belt.

70
00:04:39,736 --> 00:04:42,696
He was not looking at the boy,
but at the mist behind him.

71
00:04:43,396 --> 00:04:45,556
I am not the one you should fear.

72
00:04:46,556 --> 00:04:48,736
A creature was taking shape in the mist.

73
00:04:48,976 --> 00:04:51,876
Yone drove his crimson
blade into the boy's chest.

74
00:04:51,976 --> 00:04:56,617
But no blood flowed. The blade had seen
the name of the demon inside the boy.

75
00:04:57,317 --> 00:05:00,377
Yone spoke the name: Taan Ko'au.

76
00:05:00,677 --> 00:05:03,367
The creature took its true form and attacked.

77
00:05:03,397 --> 00:05:06,367
But Yone was faster. The demon fell,

78
00:05:06,397 --> 00:05:10,317
dissolved into mist, and became
a mask resembling the boy's face.

79
00:05:11,067 --> 00:05:14,762
If fear has a name, it has no power.

80
00:05:15,612 --> 00:05:18,433
The boy asked: Was that thing... me?

81
00:05:19,133 --> 00:05:22,313
Only a nightmare that fed on your pain.

82
00:05:22,513 --> 00:05:24,633
But it no longer defines you.

83
00:05:25,633 --> 00:05:27,983
The boy said it was his own fault.

84
00:05:28,013 --> 00:05:31,473
That he was not good enough.
That his father was right.

85
00:05:31,593 --> 00:05:33,853
For the first time, Yone's face softened.

86
00:05:34,553 --> 00:05:38,354
Those we love say the
things that hurt us most.

87
00:05:38,614 --> 00:05:44,574
Despair disguises itself as reason, but it only
shows us a twisted reflection of ourselves.

88
00:05:45,674 --> 00:05:49,354
Then he walked into the darkness.
As he left, he said one last thing:

89
00:05:49,414 --> 00:05:50,894
You will be all right, Andu.

90
00:05:52,194 --> 00:05:56,875
Every night spent hunting azakana
led him back to his brother.

91
00:05:57,035 --> 00:06:02,215
And on the night of the Spirit Blossom, years
later, the two brothers fought side by side.

92
00:06:02,965 --> 00:06:06,273
Brother... Our paths cross once again.

93
00:06:06,535 --> 00:06:08,960
Will our swords cross as well?

94
00:06:20,310 --> 00:06:25,090
Yone did not kill Yasuo. But his
brother was no longer his real concern.

95
00:06:25,150 --> 00:06:29,910
The mask on his own face was a greater
threat than anything between them.

96
00:06:30,610 --> 00:06:35,450
Yone still hunts. Every mask on
his belt is a name he has learned.

97
00:06:35,590 --> 00:06:41,790
And every name brings him a little closer to the
one whose laughter he heard in the spirit realm.

98
00:06:42,540 --> 00:06:45,107
Once, I chased the reckless wind.

99
00:06:45,690 --> 00:06:48,076
Now I hunt the dark storm.

100
00:06:48,926 --> 00:06:51,714
So what is the true name
of the azakana on his face?

101
00:06:51,976 --> 00:06:55,225
And will that mask one day devour him too?

102
00:06:56,125 --> 00:06:59,885
But there is someone else in this
story whose voice has never been heard.

103
00:07:00,065 --> 00:07:03,645
The Noxian soldier who
truly killed Elder Souma:

104
00:07:03,825 --> 00:07:04,525
Riven.

105
00:07:05,475 --> 00:07:07,781
Your crime still haunts you, Riven.

106
00:07:07,862 --> 00:07:09,385
Forgive yourself.
